  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759134,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## Romeo and Juliet - 100 Classic Book Collection (Nintendo DS)\n\nExperience Shakespeare's timeless tragedy, *Romeo and Juliet*, like never before with the 100 Classic Book Collection for Nintendo DS! This unique e-book collection brings the iconic tale of star-crossed lovers to life on your handheld console. Immerse yourself in the passionate romance and bitter feud between the Montagues and Capulets, as Romeo and Juliet defy their families and risk everything for love.\n\nHold your DS like a book and navigate the text with the touch screen, adjusting font size and background music to create your ideal reading environment. Utilize the bookmark feature to save your progress and easily resume where you left off. Explore the story with the built-in search function, delving deeper into Shakespeare’s language and the context of the play. Discover insightful introductions about the author and the work itself. \n\nThis digital edition offers a fresh perspective on a beloved classic, making Shakespeare accessible and engaging for a new generation of readers. Rediscover the power of *Romeo and Juliet* in this innovative and portable format."
    },
